        allocution: "\"I did not write that note and I did not rob that bank. The pay stub came from a trash can, and anyone could have picked it up. I'm sorry for the teller, who must have been terrified. I'd ask the court to consider that my name on a scrap of paper is not proof of who handed it over.\"",
